---
// Technical-drawing decoration for dark sections: a dashed dimension line with end
// ticks along the top edge, a short one at the bottom left and a crosshair at the
// bottom right. Every mark sits in the section's top or bottom padding and inside
// the 1216px frame, so it never lies on text or runs past the frame edge.
// Purely decorative, hidden from assistive technology.
---
<div class="blueprint" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="container bp-frame">
    <span class="bp-dim bp-dim-top"></span>
    <span class="bp-dim bp-dim-bottom"></span>
    <span class="bp-cross"></span>
  </div>
</div>
